Mon Oct 26 11:11:12 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.11.1 (upstream tag v0.11.1, 2026-10-25):
  * Integration of many contributor PRs: Edit Points segment/path
    context menu and modifier-key drags, pattern fill gallery,
    Columns dialog, AutoFormat as-you-type lists, table cell range
    selection, RTF outline save/open, Play From in the Animation
    Pane, Set Transparent Color by clicking the picture
  * Fixes for number formats (scientific, trailing-comma scaling),
    chart labels/axes/histogram bins, PPTX import/export (video
    crop, comments namespaces, paragraph builds), rendering of
    groups, tables and glows, presenter view and slide show
  * Hardening (no CVE assigned): EMF+ parsing and clipping
    complexity, PPTX import resource budgets, bounded animation and
    HTML entity scans, regular-file/size checks on read, nesting
    limit for groups, exclusive temporary directories
  * Media: bitstream, isobmff and matroska parsing moved to
    craft-media; PDF export pins craft-pdf and krilla
  * CI and packaging scripts only otherwise; no install layout
    change
  * Re-vendor (update=true): vendor tree re-audited, no new
    licences beyond the ones already listed; Legal-Review-Notice
    unchanged; cargo_vendor reports all lockfiles audited.
- Set the fixed metainfo release date to 2026-10-25 (v0.11.1).

