Sun Oct 18 17:25:40 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.8.0 (upstream tag v0.8.0, 2026-10-18):
  * Slide show: click-triggered animations, per-slide state,
    Presenter View fixes; copy/cut put text on the clipboard
  * Editing: outline levels from leading tabs; eyedropper colour
    picker; linked pictures resolve via r:link; PPTX round-trip
    keeps comments, links, shows and groups
  * Harden media importers against crafted files (no CVE
    assigned): damaged audio no longer hangs or panics; ASF
    walk arithmetic, ID3 chains, NAL units, Matroska nesting
    and AV1 tile groups validated or bounded; Opus header
    checked; quick-xml 0.41 (RUSTSEC-2026-0194,
    RUSTSEC-2026-0195)
  * MCP validates reply IDs and response frames
  * cargo_audit clean.
- Raise the cargo floor to >= 1.95, matching upstream's
  rust-version.

