- Update to version 0.7.0 (upstream tag v0.7.0, 2026-10-14):
  * Text fidelity: superscript/subscript spacing, 1.2x single spacing,
    PowerPoint wrap, gradient fills, shadows and glows, WordArt transforms
  * Rendering: two-colour gradients, pattern and compound outlines, soft edges,
    background fills, group-scale line and text fixes, 38 preset shapes
  * PPTX interop: placeholder geometry, picture-fill tiling, table styles kept,
    WMF/EMF metafiles, embedded previews, chart legends and axes
  * Interface: File tab view, Selection Pane drag and lock, CJK IME and UI,
    PowerPoint text keys, colour emoji, missing-font reporting
  * No CVE keywords in the 0.6.1-0.7.0 range; cargo_audit clean.
