- Initial package, version 0.5.0:
  * Animated GIFs play in slides, with pause (media.gifPlay)
  * Animation Painter copies and applies sequences between shapes
  * Morph turns a changed geometry outline (a circle into a star)
  * Hyperlinks drawn in the theme colour, underlined; show follows links
  * Date fields show today's date in their own format; flipped shapes
    keep their text readable
  * Slide-show transitions, colour menus and the Home button fixed;
    scalable SVG app icon for Linux desktops
  * MCP export tool lists PDF and its layout options
  * Vendor audit (update=true, no vendor/ upstream): binaries link
    MPL-2.0 symphonia audio decoding plus OFL-1.1/Ubuntu-font-1.0
    fallback fonts; CRAFT_FONTS_DIR stays unset so nothing else embeds
  * In-house H.264/HEVC/VP9/AV1 decoders implement patented
    algorithms; legal comfort for the codec patents is still open

